     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#373e4d\" face=\"helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(246,247,248)\">各位神人們好，小弟我有以下的問題</span></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,62,77);font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(246,247,248)\">資料筆數 : 1005</span></div><div><font color=\"#373e4d\" face=\"helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(246,247,248)\">變數 : 210</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#373e4d\" face=\"helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(246,247,248)\"><br></span></font></div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,62,77);font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(246,247,248)\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,62,77);font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(246,247,248)\">程式碼部分如下 : </span></div>mode0 = glm(OOSC ~ 1, data = td, family = &quot;binomial&quot;)\r\nbig = formula(glm(OOSC ~., data = td, family = &quot;binomial&quot;))\r\nbot = step(mode0, direction = &quot;both&quot;, scope = list(lower = formula(mode0), upper = big), trace = 0)</span><div><font color=\"#373e4d\" face=\"helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#373e4d\" face=\"helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Result : </span></font></div><div><font color=\"#373e4d\" face=\"helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><div><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\">(Dispersion parameter for binomial family taken to be 1)</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\">    Null deviance: 1268.02  on 1004  degrees of freedom</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Residual deviance:  486.03  on  961  degrees of freedom</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\">AIC: 574.03</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\">這自由度怎麼會比變數多，而是接近資料筆數。</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\">還是因為 R stepwise 的自由度定義不同?</span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Thanks in advance.</span></div></font><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,62,77);font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(246,247,248)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,62,77);font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.64px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(246,247,248)\"><br></span></div></div></div>"
